# Basic requests. Select the environment "httpbin" (status bar or Ctrl+Alt+Shift+E)
# and click "▶ Send Request" above a request.

### Simple GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/get
Accept: application/json

### Short form – without a method, a request is a GET
{{baseUrl}}/uuid

### Query parameters on several lines
GET {{baseUrl}}/get
    ?page=1
    &size={{pageSize}}
    &sort=name

### POST with a JSON body
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello",
  "body": "Sent from VS Code",
  "userId": 1
}

### POST a form
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Janos&city=Vienna&note=a%26b

### PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/put
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "title": "Replaced"}

### PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patch
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Changed"}

### DELETE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete

### HEAD – only the headers come back
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/get

### Error status – the response tab comes to the front
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/404

### HTML response – try "Open in browser" above the response
GET {{baseUrl}}/html

### Image response – try "Open in viewer" above the response
GET {{baseUrl}}/image/png
